acceptance_criteria.description:
emit(event, data) sends to all connected clients in SSE format (event: type
data: json

)

steps.description:
Create src/sse/broadcaster.ts. Implement SSEBroadcaster class with: private clients Set<Response>, addClient(res: Response) that adds to set and registers close/error cleanup, removeClient(res: Response) that removes from set, emit(event: CultivateSSEEventType, data: unknown) that iterates clients and writes SSE-formatted data (event: {type}
data: {json}

). Handle write errors by removing dead clients. Track client count for health monitoring.
